  # (IndexNow/GSC) fires on a completed green Validate Repo. Added 21 Sep 2026 with PR #140.
  # One build feeds six Cloudflare Pages projects (Git integration: check-runs "Cloudflare Pages:
  # local-guides-generator-{trt,pi,dentistry,neuro,uscis-medical}" and the base project on the main
  # commit), serving hormonesivhair.com, theaccidentguides.com, dentistryguides.com,
  # neuroevalguides.com and uscisexam.com. Deploy Distribution (IndexNow/GSC) runs on push to main.
  # Added 25 Sep 2026 when the Bing Webmaster fix PR #48 had no route to land on.
  local-guides-generator) DEPLOY="" ; SELF="deploys itself through Cloudflare Pages on push to main (6 projects, 5 domains)" ;;
  local-guides-citation-velocity) DEPLOY="" ; SELF="deploys itself through Cloudflare Pages on push to main; Deploy Distribution fires on green Validate Repo" ;;
  # Client repo; Cloudflare Pages builds main on push, Content Publish fires on its schedule.
  # Added 23 Sep 2026 after #28 had to be merged and its deploy checked by hand.
  hicks-consulting-canonical) DEPLOY="" ; SELF="deploys itself through Cloudflare Pages on push to main" ;;
  # Three Cloudflare Pages projects (ventures, productions, community) each build from main on push.
  join-west-peek-main)  DEPLOY="" ; SELF="deploys itself through Cloudflare Pages on push to main (3 projects)" ;;
  # The state Worker (D1 durable state) redeploys on every land; the Actions lanes read main at fire time.
  creator-network)      DEPLOY="npm run deploy:state" ; SELF="" ;;
  # Sheila's creator dashboard: one Worker (app + API + crons). The script builds the client,
