  # 26 Sep 2026 (build first, test in batches): Pages builds every push to main as the STAGING
  # preview (main.<project>.pages.dev) and the `production` branch as production; only the repo's
  # promote.yml moves that branch. The "Cloudflare Pages" check-run on the merge commit is the
  # staging build, and that is what pages_watch confirms here. 2 Oct 2026: e2e is dispatch-only,
